{"content":[{"c":["JOZABAD"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Benjamite from Gederah and one of the military men who came to David’s support at Ziklag (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.12.4","r":"1Chr.12.4","rawR":"1Chr.12.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.12.4","value":"1Chr.12.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 12:4"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2, 3. Leaders and mighty warriors from Manasseh’s tribe who joined David at Ziklag to fight against Saul (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.12.20","r":"1Chr.12.20","rawR":"1Chr.12.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.12.20","value":"1Chr.12.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 12:20"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. One of the Levites who assisted with the administration of the temple contributions in Jerusalem during King Hezekiah’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.31.13","r":"2Chr.31.13","rawR":"2Chr.31.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.31.13","value":"2Chr.31.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 31:13"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. One of the Levitical chiefs who generously gave animals to the Levites for the celebration of the Passover feast during King Josiah’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.35.9","r":"2Chr.35.9","rawR":"2Chr.35.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.35.9","value":"2Chr.35.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 35:9"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 6. Levite, the son of Jeshua, and one who helped Meremoth, Eleazar, and Noadiah take inventory of the temple’s gifts and precious metals during the days of Ezra (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.8.33","r":"Ezra.8.33","rawR":"Ezra.8.33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.8.33","value":"Ezra.8.33"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 8:33"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 7. Priest and one of the six sons of Pashhur who was encouraged by Ezra to divorce his foreign wife during the postexilic era (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.22","r":"Ezra.10.22","rawR":"Ezra.10.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.22","value":"Ezra.10.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 8. One of the Levites who was encouraged by Ezra to divorce his foreign wife (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.23","r":"Ezra.10.23","rawR":"Ezra.10.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.23","value":"Ezra.10.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:23"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 9. One of the Levites who assisted Ezra with teaching the people the law during the postexilic period (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.8.7","r":"Neh.8.7","rawR":"Neh.8.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.8.7","value":"Neh.8.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 8:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["10. One of the Levites who relocated to Jerusalem and was put in charge of the work of the temple during the days of Nehemiah (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.16","r":"Neh.11.16","rawR":"Neh.11.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.16","value":"Neh.11.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:16"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["11. Alternate rendering for Shimeath’s son in ",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.12.21","r":"2Kgs.12.21","rawR":"2Kgs.12.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.12.21","value":"2Kgs.12.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kings 12:21"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=JozacarJozachar_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"JozacarJozachar_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"JozacarJozachar_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Jozacar, Jozachar"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jozabad","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 12:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.12.4","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.12.4","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.12.4"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 12:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.12.20","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.12.20","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.12.20"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 31:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","h